  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organic Coffee Cultivation, Processing and Marketing for Producers in Chinameca, El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sociedad Cooperativa Maras Noventa y Tres (MARIAS 93) will improve the financial and administrative skills of its cooperative; incorporate the control of coffee rust in its technical assistance for farmers; develop its tourism program by constructing infrastructure and training young adults to offer services; and include persons with disabilities in its poultry farming.</narrative>
